    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual clicker incremental game inspired by Giant Bomb's Blight Club. Click the button, spend currency on unlockables, and enjoy uncovering mechanics as you go. A short, afternoon experience that can be played on your second monitor at work.<br><br>Built with React and Electron.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending Clicks on Gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barely any ludo-narrative dissonance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Unique Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hidden fees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOES NOT FEATURE:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Full Motion Video</span> actually, wait, yes it does</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actual Pickles</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A casual clicker incremental game inspired by Giant Bomb's Blight Club. Click the button, spend currency on unlockables, and enjoy uncovering mechanics as you go. A short, afternoon experience that can be played on your second monitor at work.<br><br>Built with React and Electron.<br><br><strong>FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clicking</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spending Clicks on Gimmicks</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Barely any ludo-narrative dissonance</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >15 Unique Achievements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No hidden fees</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New Game+</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DOES NOT FEATURE:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Full Motion Video</span> actually, wait, yes it does</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Controller Support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actual Pickles</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "A Giant Bomb inspired clicker-incremental game with unlockables and gimmicks to discover. A casual experience, best enjoyed on a second screen at work. Features moreish Match 3-esque mechanics.",
    "supported_languages": "English",
    "reviews": "\u201cSome art will, given time, morph alongside us. Some art will wait calmly, even stubbornly, for us to return with a new perspective. Click Click Bomb, by my estimation, has done a bit of both. It has sat patiently, confident in its mechanisms and gargantuan in its ideas, but has also shifted -- just a little bit -- while we all did our best to grow.\u201d<br>Dan Ryckert<br>",
